ps://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T12:54:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T12:54:02Z","body":"The rest of the code looks good! Do you have a specific project you're using to test it?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160049999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160058943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109080#issuecomment-3160058943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109080","id":3160058943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68Wqw_","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T12:56:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T12:56:13Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 @Alex2782 Along with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105529, this PR should be prioritized once we enter the 4.6 dev cycle given the scope of the changes and to ensure we don't introduce regressions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160058943/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160238288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109080#issuecomment-3160238288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109080","id":3160238288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68XWjQ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T13:42:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T13:42:54Z","body":"> The rest of the code looks good! Do you have a specific project you're using to test it?\r\n\r\nI've been testing with a modified version of the GDQuest TPS demo (it can run both flat screen or in VR on Quest):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/dsnopek/gdquest-tps-demo/tree/standalone-vr-slush-multithreaded\r\n\r\nNOTE: it is fairly easy to get it to crash, but I think that's due to other non-thread-safe bugs in the renderer and OpenXR. It will run for quite a while without crashing, though!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160238288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160676928","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109080#issuecomment-3160676928","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109080","id":3160676928,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68ZBpA","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T15:41:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T15:41:28Z","body":"Unfortunately, I can't test Android VR stuff, but I could check later what other complex demos there are that are optimized for Android.\r\n\r\nOnly this configuration needs to be tested?\r\n\r\n[rendering/driver/threads/thread_model](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-rendering-driver-threads-thread-model) = `Separate` (2)\r\n\r\n> Experimental: This setting has several known bugs which can lead to crashing, especially when using particles or resizing the window. Not recommended for use in production at this stage.\r\n\r\n> The thread model to use for rendering. Rendering on a thread may improve performance, but synchronizing to the main thread can cause a bit more jitter.\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160676928/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160764843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109080#issuecomment-3160764843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109080","id":3160764843,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68ZXGr","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T16:08:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T16:08:14Z","body":"> Only this configuration needs to be tested?\r\n> \r\n> [rendering/driver/threads/thread_model](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-rendering-driver-threads-thread-model) = `Separate` (2)\r\n\r\nYep!\r\n\r\nHowever, as I mentioned above, and as stated in the note from Project Settings that you shared, there are other Godot bugs with using this thread model that may lead to crashes. These should be unrelated to the Android-specific issues that this PR attempts to address, though. This PR just aims to get this mode working at all on Android with OpenGL (it already works with Vulkan, also with some bugs :-))","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160764843/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]